g", "id": "1654516845847706", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622214_1654516849181039_8083947904987662776_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HgI9RdwvKWEQ7kNvwHsC_Wv&_nc_oc=AdqN67QtWp38W2gIKgmZa-nDb0ShxiJU0F0t2BXJEDcI91sjSF2lwJP0x2APIhWTBAE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI--6eCbdohwz5P66LYnnudno73ViOI10-M2BaEcqFWHg&oe=6AB296C6"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-1-seat.png", "id": "1583885329746068", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619697_1583885336412734_1232291410291248272_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i-bo04BD7FAQ7kNvwEitzbW&_nc_oc=AdqL_tpcOCUND4BBn8Mfd-OrrwkZY7WbQMXTPEWCShHJgmE2LHm49aTtD8-YsL9Z-Cs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLkOjaCooZE8xlVTUNaKYBlKQdv8lFbwLJbTH-Hh1MOXw&oe=6AB28E29"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-3-overview.png", "id": "1957514004914617", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620875_1957514008247950_2769593181572890106_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wN9Auc2RglwQ7kNvwExInK-&_nc_oc=Adrtx_eVWmd9_l8oXNlRlBgP8p1l5hx4wmJycAzL02hScIXUO54G2fKTWMZAzZoXcqM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLkfTiNuF0IpZSQCR6CiXUOQ1coW6KNbd0VaiDypNiLeQ&oe=6AB27A1E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-5-night.png", "id": "2751702535216160", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620444_2751702538549493_3801895166710475780_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o3gpG82jxFwQ7kNvwGNSEyh&_nc_oc=AdqkzlxgQciCS6yoyrVqPGD8lfak79gU_AYR4bN1RrD3IWJBUQzlgygFh-ndCiGfpOs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLvVNREgeov2lZtuTebbi7Jw3TA-GOJPyZfKvChJNMFkQ&oe=6AB2A33F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover-landscape-2560x1440.png", "id": "1020015244080350", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623601_1020015247413683_7470808261870336801_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CUG1hZef_ygQ7kNvwH854T3&_nc_oc=AdragNFPcyeixqj_E42whNrZ0Qp7tr7g8uXJ6iTfF-hOmV3Qy60dxTYvPPZm2rkZp5M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLb7cyKfgIPKY5FK6oe0U3ryTtUADu9I4WwZM6epYNuEw&oe=6AB27703"}, "display_name": "Mahjong Table VR", "keywords": ["mahjong", "tabletop", "multiplayer", "singapore", "tiles"], "long_description": "Sit at a real mahjong table without leaving your room. Mahjong Table VR is full four-player Singapore mahjong with real physics: you pick tiles off the wall, rack them, and throw your discards onto the felt.\n\nPlay solo against three bots, or host a table and have up to three friends join from a phone or laptop with a room code. They don't need a headset and joining is free. Voice chat is built in, so the table talk comes with it.\n\nSingapore scoring, done properly: flowers and animals with instant payouts, rob-the-kong, sacred discard, dealer repeats, prevailing and seat winds, chicken hand toggle, adjustable minimum tai and caps. Stakes are counted in chips.\n\n- Full Singapore rules with a proper tai table\n- Real tile physics: wash, stack, rack, throw\n- Solo vs bots with three difficulty levels\n- Up to 4 players: friends join free from any browser, no headset needed\n- Built-in voice chat at the table\n- Mixed reality mode: put the table in your actual room\n- Play with controllers or bare hands\n- English and Chinese\n\nOne hand takes about ten minutes. Pull up a chair.", "short_description": "The only real four-player mahjong in VR. Singapore rules, real tile physics, and friends join free from any browser. "}]}, "developer_name": "Graphikate", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mahjong-vr.pages.dev/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "GRAPHIKATE PRIVATE LIMITED", "support_website_url": "https://graphikate.com/", "website_url": "https://mahjongtable.fun/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_ta